  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new feature to preview fallback shaders does not seem to work for materials that are replaced by animations.\n\nIn the attached photo, the fallback shader previewing is enabled on the avatar whose hair, face, clothing, and earmuffs materials are replaced by animations.\n\nYou can see that only the body and hair clip materials fallback to Unlit even though all materials have fallback settings.\n\nReproduction steps\n\n1. Prepare the material with fallback setting.\n\n2. Set that material by animation in default state in FX layer.\n\n3. Enable fallback shader previewing in VRChat.",
